# Multi-agent lanes

This repository is developed by parallel agents. One active writer per lane.

- Read `docs/agents/lanes.md` before editing.
- Claim a free lane in `.agent-claims/<lane>.json` before the first write.
- Work in `.worktrees/<lane>-<topic>/` when creating a branch for a lane.
- Do not edit another claimed lane. Do not share a lane by staying in different subfolders.
- Shared files (`AGENTS.md`, root `package.json`, `tsconfig.base.json`) need a coordinator task.
- After parallel merges, run root `npm test` and `npm run typecheck`.
